OL,3,GNEWSAPeople invited to help create
OL,4,Aseabird mural
OL,5,
OL,6,FIslanders have been invited to take
OL,7,Fpart in a community project to create a
OL,8,Fgiant mural celebrating seabirds and
OL,9,Fwildlife.
OL,11,FNational Trust Jersey said the mural
OL,12,Fwould be displayed on the protective
OL,13,Fscaffolding covering the pair of 4m
OL,14,F(13ft) high puffin sculptures which
OL,15,Fhave been at Plemont Bay in Jersey
OL,16,Fsince 2022.
OL,18,FThe trust is running creative workshops
OL,19,Falongside local artist James Carter to
OL,20,Fcreate a "lasting piece of artwork"
OL,21,Fwhich will be on show while the
OL,22,Fsculptures' storm damage is repaired.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
